    80	| L1 | Evaluation must decide wins by raw final banks, not shaped return (a .8 economic cap could invert the real winner) | 3.2 |
    81	| L2 | Artificial truncation keeps the real economic reward earned on that transition and adds the critic bootstrap | 3.2 |
    82	| L3 | Rank seed streams use `seed+rank` with stride `world_size` on every reset (a `rank*n_envs` offset collided) | 1.4 |
    83	| L4 | Vendoring the engine turns on `serde_json/arbitrary_precision` for the whole crate, which breaks a test-only float decode in Isaiah's `src/rules_engine/generation.rs` fixtures | 1.1 |
