The rollout uses non-blocking copies from pinned host buffers, and I found no explicit CUDA reuse fence. I’ll specify two adapter-owned buffer generations, with the trainer recording completion after all copies and the adapter waiting before reuse. The briefs will keep this separate from the historical GEMM overflow fault.


