     2	//!
     3	//! Telemetry only: gameplay, observations, rewards and the econ shaping counters never read it. Per seat and
     4	//! cumulative since the `Game` was constructed (cloned with the state, like `econ_counters`). It separates what
     5	//! the econ v4 counters merge: sales and purchases per item (units and exact integer cash), hires and land,
     6	//! produced units per product, effective / ineffective commands per verb and per actor slot, idle slots, market
     7	//! partial fills per order kind, shed-transfer partial fills, and the day-end state of service not done
     8	//! (unwatered plants, unfed / uncared animals, mature yield and fertilizer still on the tiles). These are exact
     9	//! engine events and states; none is an estimate of recoverable money (a counterfactual continuation would be).
